WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.370
- All right, let's wrap up
this hour with one more dose

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:04.699
of the Christmas spirit,
this is What I'm Liking.

00:00:04.699 --> 00:00:08.160
(upbeat music)
(crowd applauding)

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.980
So usually when you think of Santa,

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.860
you envision the plump rosy cheeks,

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.276
a bushy long silver beard,

00:00:13.276 --> 00:00:16.090
and that sort of rotund
physique, right? Well,

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:17.660
there's a new Santa in town,

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.990
and he's a straight up
silver fox people. (laughs)

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.850
This Toronto man is known
as the Fashion Santa's,

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.450
with his chiseled face and slick beard,

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.860
people all over North
America are lining up

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:31.220
to take selfies with him,
including Justin Bieber.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.740
Let's get Paul, the
Fashion Santa on the line,

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:34.893
what's up, man?

00:00:34.893 --> 00:00:37.512
(crowd applauds)
- (Paul laughing) Hey, hey.

00:00:37.512 --> 00:00:41.185
- I mean, it's like Santa
Claus had a true makeover.

00:00:41.185 --> 00:00:44.730
It was like Merry Christmas. (laughs)

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:45.858
- Happy holidays.

00:00:45.858 --> 00:00:46.760
- Oh, I love that.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.970
So how did you become
known as the Fashion Santa,

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:50.620
other than just looking like you?

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:53.093
- First I wanna say thank you
for having me on your show,

00:00:53.093 --> 00:00:56.190
I'm a big big fan, and I've
been following you forever,

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:57.608
and, thank you so much.

00:00:57.608 --> 00:00:59.965
- Oh, thank you, that
was so kind, thank you.

00:00:59.965 --> 00:01:01.104
(crowd applauds)

00:01:01.104 --> 00:01:02.621
Well I have to ask, like how,

00:01:02.621 --> 00:01:05.600
how did this come about,
the Fashion Santa thing?

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.560
- Okay, so I was a model in New
York city for about 15 years

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:12.130
and sadly my mother got
diagnosed with cancer,

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:15.140
unfortunately she passed
away, and in my grief,

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:17.430
I kind of went to sleep for a year,

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:20.331
didn't shave, that's her, Dona Mason.

00:01:20.331 --> 00:01:24.440
Didn't shave, and woke
up and just decided like,

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:28.010
I look like a Claus, and I
was in the fashion business,

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:33.010
and, put it together, made a
pitch to a couple of retailers,

00:01:33.345 --> 00:01:38.345
the mall in Toronto picked it
up and, in 2015 we went viral.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.950
We had initiatives that for every

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:42.930
selfie taking with Fashion Santa,

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:45.623
a dollar was donated
to the local hospital.

00:01:45.623 --> 00:01:46.456
- Wow!

00:01:46.456 --> 00:01:49.850
- I think we raised about
$20,000 that season.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:54.850
And it's continued, now I
have four holiday cards,

00:01:56.510 --> 00:02:01.200
that all the proceeds go to
a children's miracle network

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.770
in the US, and a sick
kids hospital in Canada.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:08.040
So, yeah, that's where it
came from so, that's it.

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:12.030
- I love the artwork as well,
that was so cool, the artwork.

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:16.120
- Yeah, that's, I
collaborated with an artists

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:19.397
from Montreal, Steve Lapeer,

00:02:19.397 --> 00:02:22.780
and we did this over like, Instagram.

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:27.490
Because of COVID, we just
kinda designed these cards,

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:31.500
just by messaging, or over like Instagram,

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.278
which is incredible.

00:02:33.278 --> 00:02:34.250
- Oh, that's incredible.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.533
Well, thank you so much Fashion Santa.

00:02:36.533 --> 00:02:37.366
(crowd applauds)

00:02:37.366 --> 00:02:40.105
I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:02:40.105 --> 00:02:41.130
(chuckles) Love that photo.

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:43.670
And that's not all, our
season long partner,

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.070
Pilot pen makers of FriXion,

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:47.160
the go-to erasable pen of
The Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.710
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly,

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:50.760
just like you my man,

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:53.343
so they're gonna give you
$1,000, how's that sound?

00:02:53.343 --> 00:02:54.294
(crowd applauds)

00:02:54.294 --> 00:02:58.440
- Wow! Oh my God! That's
amazing, that's amazing.

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.950
Thank you, thank you so much.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.490
- I know, and at some point,

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:04.560
I want a picture with Fashion
Santa, is all I'm saying.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:08.050
- Oh, yes, I definitely
would want a photo with you,

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:08.883
are you kidding?

00:03:08.883 --> 00:03:11.760
- Okay, well, it's recorded
now, we have it on film so,

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:13.570
we're gonna make it happen.

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:15.623
- Thank you so much for joining us today.

